{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》序幕演出陣容強勁！近期爆紅嘅29歲劉穎鏇（Tiffany）企正C位擔大旗領舞。入行10年的她由昔日港姐亞軍蛻變成新一代打女，近日在社交平台瘋狂被網民洗版討論，網民大讚：「佢值得紅！」</p>\n<h2>劉穎鏇張振朗為《萬千星輝賀台慶》隧道狂奔</h2>\n<p>今次大騷序幕拍攝安排充滿心思，劇組特別安排劉穎鏇聯同張振朗及劉佩玥站在前排正中間位置擔大旗。三人更首度闖入一條尚未正式通車的隧道內為這場重頭戲上演狂跑戲碼，畫面充滿速度感與視覺震撼力。張振朗亦把握這個難得機會，趁機在未啟用的新路段熟習駕駛環境，整個拍攝過程極具挑戰性。</p>\n<h2>劉穎鏇直言極度渴望接拍全新運動劇</h2>\n<p>在「903籃球賽」一夜爆紅後，劉穎鏇早前接受訪問時大方分享未來事業發展期望。她坦言在公司拍劇多年，心底裡一直盼望能有一套以運動作為核心題材的劇集找她演出，並強調如果能加入籃球元素就最為完美。「因為自己從小到大也是打籃球，覺得運動尤其籃球代表到一種精神，能在球場上展現到有多努力去做一件事。」</p>\n<h2>參選香港小姐苦熬十年憑《隱形戰隊》奪大獎</h2>\n<p>翻查資料，她早於2016年參選香港小姐勇奪亞軍及最上鏡小姐入行，至2023年終奪得《萬千星輝頒獎典禮》飛躍進步女藝員殊榮。過去她曾參演《超能使者》及《隱形戰隊》等高收視話題劇集，獲監製文偉鴻精心塑造出性感打女路線。當時為了完美演繹動作角色，她親身接受地獄式特訓，將體脂率瘋狂降至10%極限狀態。</p>\n<h2>網民力讚：佢有種親和力</h2>\n<p>這次領舞及打籃球片段曝光後，各大社交平台隨即被這股熱潮洗版，大批群眾紛紛留言表達意見。大批忠實支持者力撐Tiffany：「佢不嬲都咁好」、「佢值得紅！」、「佢有種親和力」、「Tiffany d 打戲無得頂」</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727719841993_8237553216af7d6cda685d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727719841993_8237553216af7d6cda685d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>TVB年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》序幕演出陣容強勁！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727901758536_663700426af7d6cf702d6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727901758536_663700426af7d6cf702d6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>近期爆紅嘅29歲劉穎鏇（Tiffany）企正C位擔大旗領舞。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727982066410_5407008416af7d6d01da8f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"photo_6242493416231521821_y_156214365367daaf6d61a2d-1024x576 (1).png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462727982066410_5407008416af7d6d01da8f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉穎鏇於2016年參選香港小姐勇奪亞軍及最上鏡小姐入行。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728063549926_2667563216af7d6d105f84.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"itstiffanylau_1474286645_1342736158560166635_193721100_85688635767dab2c45fad8-1024x1279.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728063549926_2667563216af7d6d105f84.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉穎鏇於2016年參選香港小姐勇奪亞軍及最上鏡小姐入行。（圖片來源：IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728229669810_8559563556af7d6d29299c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728229669810_8559563556af7d6d29299c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劉穎鏇企正C位擔大旗領舞。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728352442197_9174668466af7d6d416317.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728352442197_9174668466af7d6d416317.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大批忠實支持者力撐Tiffany：「佢不嬲都咁好」、「佢值得紅！」（圖片來源：IG@itstiffanylau）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728464183702_10031587606af7d6d4ef02e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179462728464183702_10031587606af7d6d4ef02e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>在「903籃球賽」一夜爆紅後，劉穎鏇早前接受訪問時大方分享未來事業發展期望。她坦言在公司拍劇多年，心底裡一直盼望能有一套以運動作為核心題材的劇集找她演出。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T03:59:12.007993+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1262,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T03:34:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:33:00.412860+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T03:52:33.047902+00:00","content_hash":"d42fd5e6b3420e2cceaca1f08faeec714b6652cee23ab57a2a8b5fec268c6565","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}